smithtune-training-runtime is maintained by LangChain for smithtune.

It redistributes training library code from the Fireworks AI cookbook:
https://github.com/fw-ai/cookbook
Revision: 09bbe1170c804eb5e5d7e7286f0feeef4e26055a
Upstream license: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The training Python code is preserved, with trailing newlines normalized,
except for routing its sole tinker_cookbook import to the vendored helper.
Distribution metadata is maintained separately: the distribution name and
Python requirement have changed, dependency versions are bounded, and the
Transformers requirement is 5.10.4 instead of the upstream 5.5.4 pin.
Pillow requires 12.3 or later and Datasets requires 5.0.1 or later to exclude
versions with known vulnerabilities reported during distribution validation.
Examples, tests, case studies, developer project metadata, and documentation
images are not included. Runtime resources are retained.

The upstream tree includes code from tinker-cookbook 0.4.3. Its supervised/common.py
is also included as supervised_common.py, with its exception import routed to the
existing vendored exceptions module. This removes tinker-cookbook's incompatible
Transformers constraint without changing helper behavior. Its license is
retained at training/_vendor/tinker_cookbook_0_4_3/LICENSE.

This distribution is not an official Fireworks AI release.
